      "name": "Affinity",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "SMGi6Ml15iR9sN2U",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>An affinity is an \"element\" type and is considered only for the damage system. They can also be considered damage types.</p><p>Each affinity has a status associated with it. When creatures suffer damage from a type they are vulnerable to (meaning they take increased damage) they will often also gain the associated status.</p><p></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Type</p></td><td><p>Category</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Status</p></td><td><p>Major Status</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Untyped</p></td><td><p></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Slashing</p></td><td><p>Physical</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Bleed</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Bludgeoning</p></td><td><p>Physical</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Bleed</p></td><td><p>Fracture</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Piercing</p></td><td><p>Physical</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Bleed</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Fire</p></td><td><p>Elemental</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Burn</p></td><td><p>Scorch</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Cold</p></td><td><p>Elemental</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Chill</p></td><td><p>Freeze</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Electric</p></td><td><p>Elemental</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Shock</p></td><td><p>Paralysis</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Light</p></td><td><p>Spiritual</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p>Daze</p></td><td><p>Disjoint</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Dark</p></td><td><p>Spiritual</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p></p></td><td><p>Necrosis</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Mental</p></td><td><p></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"139\"><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
      },
